{"title": "Riposte (passive feature)", "pageid": 40232, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Riposte_(passive_feature)", "categories": ["Reactions", "Class features", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Riposte_passive_feature.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0e/Riposte_passive_feature.webp/300px-Riposte_passive_feature.webp, /w/images/0/0e/Riposte_passive_feature.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0e/Riposte_passive_feature.webp/300px-Riposte_passive_feature.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0e/Riposte_passive_feature.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Riposte</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Battle_Master\" title=\"Battle Master\">Battle Master</a> Fighter passive feature and reaction. This ability allows the Battle Master to counterattack with their melee weapon when an enemy misses them with a melee attack.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>When a hostile creature misses you with a melee attack, expend a superiority die to retaliate with a powerful strike that deals an additional <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9f/Superiority_Die_d8_Icon.png/20px-Superiority_Die_d8_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9f/Superiority_Die_d8_Icon.png/30px-Superiority_Die_d8_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9f/Superiority_Die_d8_Icon.png/40px-Superiority_Die_d8_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9f/Superiority_Die_d8_Icon.png/20px-Superiority_Die_d8_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/9/9f/Superiority_Die_d8_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Superiority_Die\" title=\"Superiority Die\">Superiority Die</a> damage. \n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Details\"> Details </span></h3>\n<dl class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dt> Cost: </dt><dd> <span class=\"bg3wiki-info-blob\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/23px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/35px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/46px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/23px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Reactions\" title=\"Actions\">Reaction</a>&nbsp;+&nbsp;<span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9f/Superiority_Die_d8_Icon.png/20px-Superiority_Die_d8_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9f/Superiority_Die_d8_Icon.png/30px-Superiority_Die_d8_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9f/Superiority_Die_d8_Icon.png/40px-Superiority_Die_d8_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9f/Superiority_Die_d8_Icon.png/20px-Superiority_Die_d8_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/9/9f/Superiority_Die_d8_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Superiority_Die\" title=\"Superiority Die\">Superiority Die</a></span> </dd>\n</dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Grants:\"> Grants: </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Riposte\" title=\"Riposte\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9e/Riposte_Icon.webp/40px-Riposte_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9e/Riposte_Icon.webp/60px-Riposte_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9e/Riposte_Icon.webp/80px-Riposte_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Riposte\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9e/Riposte_Icon.webp/40px-Riposte_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9e/Riposte_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Riposte\" title=\"Riposte\">Riposte</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Classes:\n\n</p>\n<ul><li>Class level 3: <a href=\"/wiki/Battle_Master\" title=\"Battle Master\">Battle Master</a></li></ul>\n<p>Granted by the feats:\n<a href=\"/wiki/Martial_Adept\" title=\"Martial Adept\">Martial Adept</a>\n</p>\n  <p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Beorn_Wunterbrood\" title=\"Beorn Wunterbrood\">Beorn Wunterbrood</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Ca%C3%AFros\" title=\"Caïros\">Caïros</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Falc%C3%A4o\" title=\"Falcäo\">Falcäo</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Godey\" title=\"Godey\">Godey</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Holli_Dylford\" title=\"Holli Dylford\">Holli Dylford</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Liara_Portyr\" title=\"Liara Portyr\">Liara Portyr</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Nestor\" title=\"Nestor\">Nestor</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Stalker_Svignee\" title=\"Stalker Svignee\">Stalker Svignee</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/That_Which_Guards\" title=\"That Which Guards\">That Which Guards</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/That_Which_Lurks\" title=\"That Which Lurks\">That Which Lurks</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/That_Which_Watches\" title=\"That Which Watches\">That Which Watches</a></li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Riposte can only trigger from melee attacks (including melee spell attacks) made within 2 m (7 ft) away. This is slightly longer than the normal weapon range of 1.5 m (5 ft) but less than <a href=\"/wiki/Extra_Reach\" title=\"Extra Reach\">Extra Reach</a> range of 2.5 m (8 ft). This means that Riposte cannot counter full range attacks from <a href=\"/wiki/Pikes\" title=\"Pikes\">pikes</a> and similar weapons.</li>\n<li>Unlike a normal <a href=\"/wiki/Opportunity_Attack\" title=\"Opportunity Attack\">Opportunity Attack</a>, Riposte does not require you to be actively wielding a melee weapon in order to use. If you trigger it while wielding a ranged weapon, you will automatically switch to your melee weapon before performing the riposte.\n<ul><li>If you do not have any melee weapons equipped, you will perform the riposte with an unarmed strike.</li></ul></li></ul>\n</div>   <div class=\"bg3wiki-preview-only\">\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Brief_preview\"> Brief preview </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">Upon being missed with a melee attack, can expend a <a href=\"/wiki/Superiority_Die\" title=\"Superiority Die\">Superiority Die</a> to retaliate.</div>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714234057\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.042 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.047 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 940/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 10248/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 4982/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 19/200\nExp